==Battleground==
*3 [[Mooth]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 50~56.67 seconds<sup>1,500f~1,700f</sup>.
*1 [[Sinner Snache]] spawns after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>.
*1 [[Aku Doge]] spawns after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.
*2 [[Aku Gory|Aku Gories]] spawn after 56.67 seconds<sup>1,700f</sup>, delay 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>.
*2 [[Sinner Snache]]s spawn after 86.67 seconds<sup>2,600f</sup>, delay 1~2 seconds<sup>30f~60f</sup>.
*2 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 113.33 seconds<sup>3,400f</sup>, delay 1~2 seconds<sup>30f~60f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Sinner Snache]]s spawn after 166.67 seconds<sup>5,000f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
While Aku Gory appears in this level, the stage's timing makes it easily rushable, especially with an instantly spawning Mooth. A way to rush the stage or deal with Aku Gory ensures victory here.

